our algorithm.R contains the R implementation of Algorithm 1, which combines time transformation and thinning for simulating coalescent times under the bounded coalescent model.
naivesyn1data_ntip100_samplesize3000_tau0.5.rda and thinsyn1data_ntip100_samplesize3000_tau0.5.rda are the simulated datasets used to produce Figure 1 and Table 2.
comparison of three methods.R provides the partial R code used to generate Table 1, comparing the three methods included in the paper.
